ont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">OpenAI宣布下线GPT-5.3-Codex-Spark模型，该模型仅存活7个月</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">04</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">DeepSeek 传闻将发布 3 万亿参数 Code 2.0 模型，主打电脑控制功能</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">05</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">Anthropic与Rum Group签署137亿美元算力采购协议</span></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px auto;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;\"><section style=\"margin-top:-4px;padding:0 40px;outline:0;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:1.5px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">新闻速览</span></strong></section><section style=\"margin-top:-2px;width:182px;height:2px;background-color:rgb(58,19,228);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"margin-top:3px;width:182px;height:1px;background-color:rgb(111,19,209);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"outline:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(92,11,214);transform:scale(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">智谱完成50亿美元新一轮融资，将全面加速下一代GLM递归自我改进研发</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/2baaa58d47b95d420ecac165763f6ef0.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">智谱于9月13日宣布完成约50亿美元大额融资，资金将重点投入下一代GLM基础模型研发、完全自训练体系构建及算力基础设施建设。核心技术路径聚焦“完全自训练”，即让新一代GLM在上一代模型构建的智能环境中进行训练，形成递归式自我改进循环。研发重点涵盖自动化生成与筛选训练数据、任务环境搭建及长程推理能力提升。工程层面，智谱将持续推进国产芯片适配、深度算子开发与推理效率优化。此次融资标志着智谱在扩大模型训练规模的同时，正通过模型深度参与训练资源构建与底层工程优化，探索更高效率的技术迭代范式，为其下一代模型的算法体系与底层设施奠定完整研发基础。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">微软在Microsoft 365 Copilot中正式引入SpaceXAI Grok模型</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/6cac54587de973a64b1801adb05b2d26.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">微软于9月12日宣布，正式在Microsoft 365 Copilot中集成SpaceXAI的Grok模型，该模型已在Word、Excel与PowerPoint中上线。此次接入属于Microsoft Frontier项目的一部分，目前以有限预览形式向特定客户开放，旨在评估Grok在办公场景下的实际效能。这是微软继引入Anthropic Claude系列后，进一步深化多模型架构策略的关键举措。在合规性方面，SpaceXAI已被纳入微软在线服务子处理器列表，企业IT管理员需显式开启功能方可访问，并拥有数据处理的完全控制权。目前，该预览服务暂不向欧盟、欧洲自由贸易联盟国家及英国用户开放。通过对Grok进行负责任AI审核与安全验证，微软正推动企业级AI生态从单一供应商锁定向多元模型并存的模式演进。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">OpenAI宣布下线GPT-5.3-Codex-Spark模型，该模型仅存活7个月</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/4dd755b64da7d8ada7c3fbf028ebda74.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">OpenAI Codex负责人Tibo宣布，GPT-5.3-Codex-Spark模型将于下周正式退役。该模型于今年2月12日发布，作为OpenAI首个脱离英伟达技术栈、运行在Cerebras WSE-3晶圆级芯片上的生产模型，主打实时编程，曾实现每秒1200 Token的生成速度。然而，Spark因牺牲智能换取速度导致准确率不足，在Terminal-Bench 2.0中仅获58.4%评分，且存在API捏造等问题。随着8月13日Cerebras推出Ultrafast模式，旗舰模型GPT-5.6 Sol已能在保持高智能的同时实现极速推理，使得Spark作为“蒸馏版小模型”的定位失去意义。此次下线是OpenAI模型库激进换血的一部分，标志着“快”已从独立模型演变为旗舰模型的一项标配档位。Spark作为过渡期探路者，</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">DeepSeek 传闻将发布 3 万亿参数 Code 2.0 模型，主打电脑控制功能</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/da843633b4ac67272f7891943b557d56.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">DeepSeek 计划于 9 月推出全新旗舰大模型 DeepSeek Code 2.0，该模型参数量将突破 3 万亿，旨在通过 AI 自动操作电脑完成复杂任务。在产品布局上，DeepSeek 近期已发布架构大幅升级的 V4.1Flash，并确认后续将推出 V4.1Pro 系列。Code 2.0 延续了 DeepSeek 开源开放的传统，其性能目标直指 Mythos 5.1 和 GPT-6 Astra 等前沿模型。相较于目前国内主流模型（如 K3 的 2.8 万亿、Qwen 3.8 Max 的 2.4 万亿及 V4 Pro 的 1.6 万亿参数），Code 2.0 在参数规模上实现显著跃升。此次产品迭代通过多路线并行策略，进一步强化了 DeepSeek 在代码生成与逻辑推理领域的竞争力，旨在通过 Agent 化的</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Anthropic与Rum Group签署137亿美元算力采购协议</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/b4f4448480253fe844402095282b8821.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">Anthropic与Rum Group正式签署一份为期六年的算力采购协议，合同总价值达137亿美元。Rum Group作为一家具备社交媒体背景及特定政治关联的企业，此次合作将进一步扩充Anthropic的算力储备。该协议是Anthropic近期大规模算力布局的重要组成部分，此前其已与Google、SpaceX及Nscale等厂商达成合作。目前，Anthropic通过多方协议累计锁定的算力规模已达14.8吉瓦，未来十年总投入预计最高可达5170亿美元。此次与Rum Group的交易旨在应对Claude Code与Cowork等产品需求激增带来的算力压力，通过持续加厚算力底座，确保其AI模型训练与推理业务的稳定性，进一步巩固其在高性能计算资源获取方面的竞争优势。</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
